auth {
  mode: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

docs {
  # codegames-v2 API

  - Pick the **Local** environment (top right) before sending requests.
  - `baseUrl` already includes the `/api/v1` prefix.
  - Auth is set once here (Bearer `{{token}}`) and every request inherits it.
    Set `token` in the environment; it is a secret variable, so its value is stored by Bruno, not in these files.
    Routes don't check auth yet, so an empty token is fine for now.
}
